### Example 3 [getter_setter]
// Source: 30-782:DefaultParser.267-281:getLongPrefix
```java
private String getLongPrefix(final String token) {
        final String t = Util.stripLeadingHyphens(token);

        int i;
        String opt = null;
        for (i = t.length() - 2; i > 1; i--) {
            final String prefix = t.substring(0, i);
            if (options.hasLongOption(prefix)) {
                opt = prefix;
                break;
            }
        }

        return opt;
    }
```
== translates to ==
```cangjie
let t = Util.stripLeadingHyphens(token)
var opt: String = ""
var i = t.size - 2
while (i > 1) {
let prefix = t[0..i]
if (options.hasLongOption(prefix)) {
opt = prefix
break
}
i--
}
return opt
```
