The following are verified translation examples from similar code patterns. Use them as reference.

### Example 1 [exception]
// Source: 46-229:OSInfo.138-153:getHardwareName
```java
static String getHardwareName() {
        try {
            Process p = Runtime.getRuntime().exec("uname -m");
            p.waitFor();

            InputStream in__ = p.getInputStream();
            try {
                return readFully(in__);
            } finally {
                in__.close();
            }
        } catch (Throwable e) {
            System.err.println("Error while running uname -m: " + e.getMessage());
            return "unknown";
        }
    }
```
== translates to ==
```cangjie
static func getHardwareName(): String {
    try {
        let p = Runtime.getRuntime().exec("uname -m")
        p.waitFor()
        let in__ = p.getInputStream()
        try {
            return readFully(in__)
        } finally {
            in__.close()
        }
    } catch (e: Throwable) {
        System.err.println("Error while running uname -m: " + e.getMessage())
        return "unknown"
    }
}
```
